> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Role Codes**: Please confirm that `SCM` and `CDM` are the exact Role IDs configured in `MKT_USER.Role` and `MKT_ROLE.ID` in your database. If different role codes are used (e.g., `SCM_HO` or `CR_MGR`), they can be adjusted in the SQL configuration script below.

> [!NOTE]
> **Delimited Syntax Standard**: The workflow configuration parameter will use `"CPO,SCM | CAO,CDM"`. Pipe `|` separates groups; commas or spaces separate roles within each group. The legacy format `"CPO CAO"` remains fully supported for backward compatibility.

